- **Overflow Handling:** Checks if the new data fits into the buffer; returns NULL in case of insufficient space.
- **Median Calculation:** Uses a helper function (`findMedian`) that sorts the relevant portion of the buffer to compute the median efficiently.

This code provides an efficient way to manage incoming real-time data samples, ensuring minimal latency and optimal memory usage while supporting concurrent access.']

